"""Scan worker.

Claims one job at a time from the database queue and processes it.
Fetch the jar (and pom) -> resolve dependencies -> run JSymCompiler + syrs
-> zip the output -> upload the zip -> publish to trusted (Nexus-origin
jobs only) -> record the result in the dedup ledger.

Multiple workers can run in parallel so job claiming uses row locking
(FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED), so no job is ever processed twice.
"""

